From f2ad0562595af26dbfe70d005bab03f1cb20f70d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:01:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make the screen cursor optional (default off)

Adds the client convar mediaplayer_screen_cursor and a Controls section with a
checkbox in the sidebar settings. When off, no hook runs and the page never
takes the cursor. Toggling applies immediately, including while the context
menu is open, and releases the page when turned off mid-hover.
